ent-LavaBoat = hide boat
    .desc = A shallow hull of goliath hide stretched over a bone frame. Its cargo net keeps equipment and hunting trophies out of the lava.
ent-BoneOar = bone oar
    .desc = A broad bone blade lashed to a long shaft. Keep it in hand to row a hide boat across the lava.
ent-AshDrakeTrophy = drake spine
    .desc = A fire-hardened ash drake spine surrounded by thick scales. A master hunter can work it into armor.
ent-ColossusTrophy = colossus carapace
    .desc = A dense colossus fragment with hollow, resonating channels. It can reinforce a hunter's shield.
ent-HierophantTrophy = hierophant crystal
    .desc = A vibrating crystal from a fallen hierophant. Bound to a bone haft, it lends its blows a tremendous impact.
ent-BubblegumTrophy = bubblegum claws
    .desc = Serrated demonic claws that remain sharp enough to carve through thick hides.
ent-ClothingOuterArmorDrakeAshWalker = drake scale armor
    .desc = Interlocking drake scales sewn over goliath hide. The heavy mantle guards an ash walker against claws and flame.
ent-ClothingHeadHoodDrakeAshWalker = drake scale hood
    .desc = A hood of overlapping scales shaped for an ash walker's head.
ent-ShieldColossusAshWalker = colossus shield
    .desc = Dense carapace bound to a round hide shield. It absorbs heavy blows, but each impact wears away its ancient shell.
ent-HammerHierophantAshWalker = resonant bone maul
    .desc = A hierophant crystal suspended in a cage of bone. A two-handed blow knocks prey away from its wielder.
ent-DaggerBloodAshWalker = blood claw
    .desc = Bubblegum's serrated claw bound into a bone grip. Its curved edge tears deep wounds and swiftly butchers a hunter's kill.
lava-boat-no-shore = There is no accessible shore nearby.
lava-boat-cargo-shore = Pull the boat onto shore first, or the cargo will fall into the lava.
lava-boat-cargo-open = The cargo net is open. Secure it before rowing.
lava-boat-cargo-closed = The cargo net is secured. Occupied spaces: { $count }/{ $capacity }.
